      "instance_name": "Adolf_Hitler",
      "label": "Adolf Hitler",
      "description": "Adolf Hitler was the leader of Nazi Germany and the primary architect of the Holocaust. His actions and ideology resulted in the genocide of millions of Jews and other groups. The meme relies on his historical identity to make its grotesque and hateful point.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
