      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Holocaust_denial_minimization_themes",
      "label": "Holocaust denial/minimization themes",
      "description": "These are attempts to downplay, distort, or deny the scale and horror of the Holocaust. The meme trivializes the genocide by reducing it to a casual, nonchalant act, which is a form of minimization that risks desensitizing viewers to the historical atrocity.",
