      "instance_name": "Nazi_Germany",
      "label": "Nazi Germany",
      "description": "Nazi Germany was the totalitarian regime led by Adolf Hitler from 1933 to 1945, characterized by extreme nationalism, racism, and totalitarian control. The historical context of Nazi Germany is necessary to understand the origin and nature of the atrocities described in the meme.",
