      "description": "The global effort to remember, honor, and educate about the Holocaust through memorials, museums, and educational initiatives. The meme's attempt to trivialize the Holocaust directly contradicts the purpose of memorialization, making this background knowledge essential to understanding the meme's hateful intent.",
